Upstream-Name: qore-xml-module
Upstream-Contact: David Nichols <david@qore.org>
Source: https://github.com/qoretechnologies/module-xml
Files-Excluded: test/wsdl-interop/oracle/*.jar
 test/wsdl-interop/axis-peer/jars/*.jar
 test/wsdl-interop/cxf-peer/jars/*.jar
 test/enterprise.wsdl
 test/partner.wsdl
 test/wsdl-interop/normative/rfc2392.txt
Comment: Exclude prebuilt Java interoperability dependencies. Java peer tests
 require separately provisioned dependencies; the Qore package tests do not.
 The two generated Salesforce WSDLs have no redistribution license
 in their notices and are omitted; their original-byte regression test skips
 explicitly without them. Live Salesforce tests require a user-supplied WSDL
 and credentials.
 The RFC reference text is omitted because it is not DFSG-free and is not
 needed by the Qore package tests.
 The libxml2 component separately excludes test and result, following the
 distribution libxml2 repack to omit test data with unclear licensing.

